{"info": {"address1": "Umang Tower", "address2": "5th Floor Mindspace, Off. Link Road Malad (West)", "city": "Mumbai", "zip": "400064", "country": "India", "phone": "91 22 4249 7000", "fax": "91 22 2880 8877", "website": "https://www.shoppersstop.com", "industry": "Department Stores", "industryKey": "department-stores", "industryDisp": "Department Stores", "sector": "Consumer Cyclical", "sectorKey": "consumer-cyclical", "sectorDisp": "Consumer Cyclical", "longBusinessSummary": "Shoppers Stop Limited engages in the retail of various household and consumer products through retail and departmental stores in India. The company offers casual, formal, Indian and festive, winter, inner, sleep, western, fusion, lingerie, and lounge wear products; athleisure and footwear products; watches, accessories, and sunglasses and frames; bags and wallets, luggage and trolleys, jewelries, hair accessories, caps and hats, socks, and protective gears for men's, women's, and kids. It also provides makeup products for face, eyes, lips, and nails; tools and brushes; makeup kits; cleansers and exfoliators, toners and mists, and moisturizers; eye, sun, and lip care products; masks and treatments; and kits and combos for skin; shampoo and conditioner, styling, and tool products for hair; bath and shower, body care, hand and feet, and feminine hygiene products; fragrances; beauty and hair accessories; men's grooming products; and house warming, wedding, and other gifts. In addition, the company offers bed sheets, quilts comforters and dohars, pillows, covers and protectors, and diwan sets; cushions covers and filters, chair pads and covers, dining table covers, and yoga mats; dinnerware, serve ware, tabletops, cutlery, drinkware, tea and coffee products, and table linens; and cook and bakeware, food preps and tools, storage solutions, and table and kitchen linens. Further, it provides towel and laundry products; bath and cleaning accessories; kitchen and home appliances; idols and figurines, candles, holders, vases and flowers, and garden products; wall and d\u00e9cor accents; and lamps. Additionally, the company is involved in the distribution of international beauty brands. It offers its products through HomeStop and Shoppers Stop stores, as well as through mobile applications and website. Shoppers Stop Limited was founded in 1991 and is based in Mumbai, India.", "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Kavindra  Mishra", "age": 51, "title": "MD, CEO & Executive Director", "yearBorn": 1974, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 55000004, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Rakeshkumar Sanwarmal Saini", "title": "Vice President of Legal, Company Secretary & Chief Compliance Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 10660000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Pankaj Mahesh Chaturvedi", "age": 43, "title": "Chief Financial Officer", "yearBorn": 1982, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Sandeep  Jabbal", "age": 48, "title": "Customer Care Associate, Chief Digital Transformation & Information Officer", "yearBorn": 1977, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Jiten  Mahendra", "title": "Customer Care Associate and Chief Marketing & Communication Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Nabamita  Banerjee", "title": "Customer Care Associate & Chief Human Resource Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Deepak  Yadav M.B.A.", "age": 46, "title": "Customer Care Executive & Chief of Business Expansion and Projects", "yearBorn": 1979, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Arvind  Rajagopalan", "age": 52, "title": "Customer Care Associate & Chief Retail Officer", "yearBorn": 1973, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercised